index 0000000000000..34117ed1c3c71
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tools/um-arm64/doc/60-continuation.md
@@ -0,0 +1,374 @@
+# Continuation notes
+
+Everything needed to pick this up cold. The other documents describe the port;
